WEBVTT

01:36.160 --> 01:40.979
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.330 --> 01:43.940
[Episode 4]

01:49.680 --> 01:51.880
Tang Rou, I'll go save the others first.

01:52.759 --> 01:55.560
I probably won't need the entire jar
of Nether Dew.

01:56.000 --> 01:58.229
Your sister wants Nether Dew as a gift,

01:58.840 --> 02:01.900
but she doesn't necessarily
need the whole jar, right?

02:03.040 --> 02:04.170
That's right, Fang.

02:10.870 --> 02:12.800
You'd better not play tricks on me.

02:20.290 --> 02:22.280
[Wonder Liquor Inn]

02:44.820 --> 02:45.550
Big Brother.

02:47.120 --> 02:48.200
Chaoran, Yuhan.

02:48.520 --> 02:51.050
Let's go upstairs to
detoxify Mr. Feng first.

02:54.560 --> 02:55.430
Fang.

02:55.800 --> 02:57.120
Just help Big Brother

02:57.710 --> 02:59.970
remove the Silver Butterfly Dart, okay?

03:11.360 --> 03:11.910
Let's go.

03:12.470 --> 03:13.000
Let's go.

03:18.470 --> 03:19.200
Let's begin.

03:21.680 --> 03:23.810
Before removing the dart, let's talk.

03:27.310 --> 03:29.370
I have nothing to talk about with you.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.400
Fine. Let's not talk then.

03:39.360 --> 03:40.290
I'm warning you—

03:40.750 --> 03:43.400
Rou is innocent and trusting.

03:43.840 --> 03:45.910
He keeps calling you Big Brother now.

03:46.400 --> 03:48.470
I'm afraid he's been thoroughly
deceived by you.

03:48.470 --> 03:51.030
I don't care what happened
between you two before,

03:51.030 --> 03:53.560
but stay away from Rou from now on.

03:58.840 --> 03:59.520
Alright.

04:08.240 --> 04:09.040
Smart choice.

04:11.520 --> 04:12.560
I do agree,

04:13.280 --> 04:15.150
but whether Rou wants to follow me or not

04:15.150 --> 04:16.310
isn't up to me.

04:17.160 --> 04:18.220
You have to ask him.

04:19.310 --> 04:21.970
Don't worry about that.
Just keep your promise.

04:40.510 --> 04:43.270
Your set of tools looks well-prepared.

04:44.950 --> 04:46.430
You must be rather experienced

04:46.430 --> 04:48.159
in removing darts, aren't you?

04:49.190 --> 04:50.310
If the dart were shot by me,
you'd be dead by now.

04:50.310 --> 04:52.640
There wouldn't be any chance to remove it.

04:56.920 --> 04:57.600
Take a look.

04:58.120 --> 05:01.120
What do you think of this one
that's three inches long?

05:07.160 --> 05:08.680
What do you mean what I think?

05:08.680 --> 05:09.540
Why ask me that?

05:11.190 --> 05:11.800
Scared?

05:13.720 --> 05:15.830
Me, scared? Let's get on with it.

05:37.430 --> 05:38.760
Wait, that's not right.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.560
There's still more in there.

05:40.560 --> 05:41.490
A month from now,

05:42.270 --> 05:44.670
if you have no more entanglements
with Rou,

05:45.159 --> 05:46.690
I'll remove the other dart.

05:52.000 --> 05:52.730
You lowlife.

05:54.040 --> 05:55.500
Blame the way of the world.

05:56.800 --> 05:57.530
Big Brother!

05:58.830 --> 05:59.560
Big Brother.

05:59.830 --> 06:00.630
It went great.

06:01.430 --> 06:03.690
Mr. Feng's poison has been neutralized.

06:10.270 --> 06:11.040
Fang.

06:12.310 --> 06:14.170
Give me the rest of the Nether Dew.

06:14.430 --> 06:15.390
Well, Fang,

06:22.480 --> 06:24.870
the wine is all gone.

06:32.510 --> 06:33.840
Are you messing with me?

06:36.310 --> 06:38.240
Blame the way of the world, I guess?

06:39.240 --> 06:42.570
Why the glare? You were the one
who was unkind from the start.

06:49.190 --> 06:50.360
Big Brother! You...

06:54.070 --> 06:55.470
What exactly do you want?

06:57.800 --> 07:00.920
My Silver Butterfly Dart
has its body and wings connected.

07:00.920 --> 07:03.560
It's up to you whether you want to
suffer the consequences.

07:03.560 --> 07:05.490
You're skilled at brewing, right?

07:06.070 --> 07:08.070
Reproduce a jar of Nether Dew for me.

07:08.430 --> 07:10.030
I'll be checking it tonight.

07:10.270 --> 07:12.000
If it's not convincing enough,

07:12.310 --> 07:13.970
you can find out what happens.

07:25.240 --> 07:26.700
Are you okay, Big Brother?

07:31.190 --> 07:33.480
Does it hurt?

07:35.630 --> 07:36.690
Of course it hurts.

07:37.750 --> 07:38.360
Tang Rou,

07:39.480 --> 07:41.340
can you remove the remaining dart

07:41.950 --> 07:43.120
for me?

07:44.310 --> 07:45.640
It really hurts so much.

07:46.560 --> 07:47.760
I can't, Big Brother.

07:48.070 --> 07:49.680
In our Tang Sect,
everyone's hidden weapons

07:49.680 --> 07:51.280
have their own unique style.

07:51.390 --> 07:52.000
Besides,

07:53.560 --> 07:54.800
Fang is so skilled.

07:55.240 --> 07:56.500
If I interfere rashly,

07:56.950 --> 07:59.080
your arm will be permanently damaged.

08:01.120 --> 08:02.380
What should we do then?

08:03.120 --> 08:04.380
What choice do we have?

08:05.720 --> 08:07.520
Time to start blending the wine.

08:25.750 --> 08:27.710
["Red Phoenix" Song Mingzhu of Power Gang]

08:28.240 --> 08:28.850
Master.

08:44.560 --> 08:47.240
It's my fault for
failing to assist you in time, Master.

08:47.240 --> 08:48.440
I never expected such a traitor to appear

08:48.440 --> 08:49.700
within our Power Gang.

08:53.120 --> 08:55.870
Has the poison in your body been
completely cured, Master?

08:55.870 --> 08:58.200
Otherwise, I would never forgive myself.

08:58.270 --> 09:00.870
You've always been closest
to Purple Phoenix.

09:01.080 --> 09:03.910
Did you not notice
anything unusual about her?

09:06.720 --> 09:08.150
I, Song Mingzhu, swear to heaven

09:08.150 --> 09:09.550
that my loyalty to you
is absolute, Master.

09:09.550 --> 09:10.600
If you have even the slightest suspicion
of me, Master,

09:10.600 --> 09:11.720
please kill me now.

09:15.220 --> 09:16.620
I haven't killed you yet,

09:17.440 --> 09:19.100
so there's no need to say more.

09:22.760 --> 09:26.400
[A few days ago at Changle Escort Agency]

09:30.080 --> 09:32.320
Zheng Kaiyang, where is Old Madam Wu?

09:30.710 --> 09:32.200
[Zheng Kaiyang, Changle Escort Agency]

09:32.730 --> 09:34.230
[Purple Phoenix, Power Gang]

09:33.010 --> 09:34.630
Hand over the Hero Command Token,

09:34.630 --> 09:36.240
and I shall leave your body intact!

09:36.240 --> 09:39.080
Purple Phoenix,
your Power Gang has gone too far!

09:39.750 --> 09:43.150
Today, our Changle Escort Agency
will fight you to the death!

10:33.120 --> 10:33.870
Liu Suifeng?

10:36.150 --> 10:38.050
[Liu Suifeng, Deputy Chief of Power Gang]

10:40.000 --> 10:41.660
Greetings, Deputy Chief Liu.

10:46.630 --> 10:49.270
You couldn't even handle
a mere Changle Escort Agency?

10:49.270 --> 10:51.330
Please forgive me, Deputy Chief Liu.

10:57.670 --> 10:59.470
Purple Phoenix, remember this:

10:59.750 --> 11:01.750
I never give anyone a second chance.

11:02.550 --> 11:03.030
Yes.

11:03.080 --> 11:04.600
Go! Hurry up! Move!

11:04.910 --> 11:05.790
-Move!
-Father!

11:05.790 --> 11:06.850
-Father!
-Father!

11:08.790 --> 11:09.870
Liu Suifeng!

11:10.870 --> 11:11.390
Father!

11:12.120 --> 11:13.180
-Father!
-Father!

11:17.320 --> 11:18.080
Let me go!

11:21.720 --> 11:23.510
Give him the time it takes
for an incense stick to burn.

11:23.510 --> 11:25.200
Start with his eldest son.

11:27.250 --> 11:27.840
Father!

11:28.550 --> 11:28.960
Father!

11:28.960 --> 11:30.600
I didn't take the Hero's Token.

11:30.600 --> 11:32.240
I really didn't take it!

11:53.240 --> 11:54.240
Deputy Chief Liu.

11:57.840 --> 11:59.030
Zheng Kaiyang confessed.

11:59.030 --> 12:00.510
But the one with the token's not here.

12:00.510 --> 12:01.600
On their escort route,

12:01.600 --> 12:02.860
they found Old Madam Wu

12:03.030 --> 12:05.270
and did want to steal
the Hero Command Token from her.

12:05.270 --> 12:06.030
However, Zhang Linyi,

12:06.030 --> 12:08.910
the Yin-Yang Divine Swordsman
accompanying Old Madam Wu got suspicious.

12:08.910 --> 12:11.840
Once they entered Jinzhong,
they lost track of them.

12:12.510 --> 12:14.390
But it's said that Old Madam Wu

12:14.750 --> 12:16.880
boarded the carriage of Huanhua Sect.

12:21.200 --> 12:22.600
Huanhua Sect?

12:26.790 --> 12:28.650
We also found the Marching Pills,

12:28.870 --> 12:31.670
supposedly meant for
the Northern Wastelanders.

12:59.510 --> 13:00.440
Purple Phoenix.

13:03.670 --> 13:04.840
Who bribed you

13:05.910 --> 13:07.510
to take my life?

13:44.870 --> 13:45.930
How did you know...

13:46.630 --> 13:48.890
How did you know
I was going to poison you?

13:51.270 --> 13:52.930
You came all this way to kill me

13:53.720 --> 13:56.380
and even brought
my favorite Qishan Cuimei tea.

14:04.720 --> 14:06.910
You think only the tea was poisoned?

14:08.510 --> 14:11.170
Fifth Master Liu, you're immune
to all poisons,

14:11.480 --> 14:13.000
but whenever you encounter Marching Pills,

14:13.000 --> 14:14.660
you'll definitely take them.

14:14.750 --> 14:17.600
So in this Marching Pill,

14:18.670 --> 14:20.960
I infused the non-toxic poison,

14:22.790 --> 14:25.120
the Noxious Beetles.

14:31.390 --> 14:35.120
You think I'm the only one
in Power Gang

14:36.600 --> 14:38.320
who wants you dead?

15:04.000 --> 15:04.730
Who's there?

15:21.870 --> 15:22.870
Feng Lang?

15:25.720 --> 15:27.200
He called me "lucky bag."

15:29.240 --> 15:29.960
Get up.

15:35.720 --> 15:38.200
I never thought that
in the midst of fleeing the chase,

15:38.200 --> 15:40.860
I casually killed someone
and took their place,

15:40.910 --> 15:43.510
yet Xiao Qiushui would trust me
so completely.

15:45.670 --> 15:46.470
Song Mingzhu.

15:47.670 --> 15:49.470
Do you know what kind of identity

15:49.750 --> 15:52.550
is referred to as "lucky bag"
in the martial world?

15:53.840 --> 15:55.100
I've never heard of it.

15:55.360 --> 15:57.160
Could it be some official title?

16:01.360 --> 16:03.290
Xiao Qiushui kept calling me that.

16:03.840 --> 16:05.150
I wonder what he meant.

16:07.840 --> 16:08.480
Anyway,

16:09.870 --> 16:11.000
with this identity,

16:11.150 --> 16:13.750
I can enter the Xiao family
before Sword King.

16:14.440 --> 16:16.000
All his schemes

16:16.360 --> 16:18.480
to have Purple Phoenix come kill me
were in vain.

16:18.480 --> 16:19.600
Master, you mean

16:20.870 --> 16:23.800
Purple Phoenix attacked you
on Sword King's orders?

16:25.200 --> 16:28.200
Whoever gets the Hero Command Token
for Chief

16:28.630 --> 16:30.150
will earn great merit,

16:31.390 --> 16:33.850
and Sword King and I
have never gotten along.

16:33.910 --> 16:34.840
If he gets it,

16:35.390 --> 16:37.320
he'll naturally use it against me.

16:40.510 --> 16:41.640
Yet, as it turns out,

16:42.790 --> 16:45.520
he has unwittingly delivered me
a masterstroke.

16:45.550 --> 16:46.600
You're blessed with great fortune, Master,

16:46.600 --> 16:48.720
having met that guy from the Xiao family.

16:48.720 --> 16:50.790
I heard they formed

16:50.790 --> 16:52.270
something called
Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

16:52.270 --> 16:55.000
Always talking about chivalry.
How ridiculous.

16:55.550 --> 16:56.810
In this martial world,

16:57.870 --> 17:00.750
the word "righteousness"
has long since died.

17:02.030 --> 17:04.160
They're just a bunch of hypocrites,

17:04.160 --> 17:06.560
chasing profit
yet too ashamed to admit it.

17:07.400 --> 17:10.400
Sooner or later, they'll kneel before
our Power Gang.

17:10.400 --> 17:12.589
The Huanhua Sect is easy to defend
but hard to attack.

17:12.589 --> 17:15.480
Using this identity
to go with Xiao Qiushui

17:16.200 --> 17:18.200
will truly make things much easier.

17:18.589 --> 17:19.200
The Hero's Token

17:19.200 --> 17:21.460
will soon be in your possession, Master.

17:21.829 --> 17:24.000
Then you can bring the Xiao family
under your control.

17:24.000 --> 17:25.480
Let's see how that Sword King
can fight against you then.

17:25.480 --> 17:28.540
The Xiao family doesn't deserve to be
under my command.

17:31.440 --> 17:34.510
I still have a score to settle with them.

17:39.160 --> 17:39.760
By the way,

17:40.590 --> 17:43.030
don't let Sword King know of
my whereabouts.

17:43.030 --> 17:45.760
This Xiao Qiushui
does resemble Chief somewhat.

17:46.640 --> 17:48.880
In our gang, only the Eight Kings

17:49.270 --> 17:51.470
have seen the true faces of me and Chief.

17:51.680 --> 17:53.070
Even if the Eight Kings see him,

17:53.070 --> 17:54.930
they won't mistake him for Chief.

17:55.720 --> 17:56.980
No need to report this.

17:57.200 --> 17:58.510
Just wait for my instructions.

17:58.510 --> 17:59.030
Got it.

17:59.350 --> 18:02.350
I'll wait near Huanhua Sect
for your message, Master.

18:05.200 --> 18:05.930
Big Brother.

18:06.070 --> 18:07.310
What do you think of this?

18:07.310 --> 18:08.840
I think this is pretty good.

18:16.720 --> 18:18.250
Thank you all for saving me.

18:23.030 --> 18:25.440
Mr. Feng, seeing you like this,

18:26.030 --> 18:27.360
are you feeling better?

18:27.550 --> 18:30.080
I'm much better now.
I can't thank you enough.

18:31.640 --> 18:33.170
Don't mention it, Mr. Feng.

18:33.310 --> 18:34.170
Our Big Brother

18:34.200 --> 18:36.160
was actually looking for someone
named Feng Lang.

18:36.160 --> 18:38.160
We never expected to really find you.

18:38.160 --> 18:40.360
I'm just a nobody not worth mentioning.

18:41.310 --> 18:43.400
I spoke ill before,

18:44.680 --> 18:46.310
Mr. Xiao, yet you didn't take offense

18:46.310 --> 18:49.590
and even saved me multiple times.
I'm truly grateful for that.

18:49.590 --> 18:53.390
Should you ever require my service
in the future, I shall not refuse.

18:54.000 --> 18:55.260
That's not important.

18:59.240 --> 19:00.300
What matters is...

19:00.750 --> 19:02.280
Do you consider me a friend?

19:03.110 --> 19:06.270
Do you now consider me your best friend?

19:07.350 --> 19:09.510
Mr. Xiao, you're my close friend.

19:16.440 --> 19:17.160
Alright.

19:19.270 --> 19:20.270
That's good then.

19:20.550 --> 19:22.270
Actually, it's quite a coincidence.

19:22.270 --> 19:24.830
After much effort, the Iron-Clad Constable
entrusted someone to find my master,

19:24.830 --> 19:26.680
asking me to deliver a letter to him
at Huanhua Sect.

19:26.680 --> 19:29.340
It just so happens
I can travel with you, Mr. Xiao

19:30.680 --> 19:32.310
Y-You've just recovered from poisoning.

19:32.310 --> 19:34.480
There must still be some residual toxins
in your body.

19:34.480 --> 19:35.340
How about this?

19:35.880 --> 19:37.350
Come back with me to Huanhua Sect,

19:37.350 --> 19:40.110
and I'll find someone to help clear
the remaining poison from your body.

19:40.110 --> 19:41.110
What do you think?

19:41.830 --> 19:42.270
Okay.

19:43.200 --> 19:44.130
Where's my wine?

19:47.440 --> 19:49.550
If there's no wine, nobody leaves.

19:53.680 --> 19:54.440
Fang.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.160
Wait here.

20:08.400 --> 20:10.400
Can this wine fool her, Big Brother?

20:21.550 --> 20:23.550
Feng, please don't be angry.

20:24.640 --> 20:25.830
You're already injured,

20:25.830 --> 20:27.640
and now you've caught a cold
from the water.

20:27.640 --> 20:29.640
It'll get worse if we don't treat it.

20:29.950 --> 20:32.560
Here's the medicine. Come on, take it.

20:39.880 --> 20:42.110
Are you Tang Fang from the Tang Sect?

20:49.110 --> 20:49.970
And who are you?

20:58.420 --> 21:00.750
I am Feng Lang, the owner of
the Rain Sword.

21:03.150 --> 21:06.410
So you're that sickly fellow
who used up all the Nether Dew.

21:07.960 --> 21:10.920
Let me tell you, you're part of this too.

21:16.640 --> 21:17.400
Fang.

21:20.000 --> 21:20.600
Your wine.

21:37.270 --> 21:38.030
Fang!

21:39.310 --> 21:41.350
You're fooling me. It's all fake!

21:46.800 --> 21:49.200
Tang Fang, I've put up with you
long enough.

21:49.640 --> 21:51.680
If it weren't for Tang Rou's sake...

21:51.900 --> 21:52.820
Let me tell you.

21:53.550 --> 21:54.950
If it weren't for you all,

21:55.240 --> 21:58.370
I would have already
knocked the Omniscience Door open.

21:59.030 --> 22:01.890
Keep brewing. If you can't get it done,
don't sleep.

22:04.750 --> 22:05.510
Miss.

22:06.680 --> 22:07.870
You're heading to the Omniscience Door

22:07.870 --> 22:08.920
to consult Jade Cicada,

22:08.920 --> 22:11.030
hoping to gain some insight
into the martial world, right?

22:11.030 --> 22:12.760
Perhaps I can be of assistance.

22:15.200 --> 22:15.790
You?

22:17.590 --> 22:19.990
I'm somewhat acquainted with Jade Cicada.

22:22.430 --> 22:23.960
Give him this jade pendant,

22:24.790 --> 22:26.160
and he'll speak once.

22:42.160 --> 22:43.620
Just this one jade pendant

22:43.830 --> 22:45.290
to make Jade Cicada speak?

22:45.750 --> 22:47.550
You must be a fraud too, aren't you?

22:47.550 --> 22:50.010
I'm about to go to Huanhua Sect
with Mr. Xiao.

22:50.270 --> 22:51.270
If this doesn't work,

22:51.270 --> 22:52.400
you can come find me.

22:52.830 --> 22:55.000
That's better than wasting time here.

22:55.440 --> 22:56.030
Fine.

22:56.880 --> 22:59.210
Huanhua Sect is not far from
our Tang Sect.

23:00.030 --> 23:01.240
You won't get away.

23:04.830 --> 23:05.550
Hold on.

23:20.550 --> 23:24.280
My friend helped you. You should
return the favor, don't you think?

23:24.680 --> 23:28.080
Fang, your Silver Butterfly Dart
is going deeper and deeper.

23:28.440 --> 23:29.830
If you don't remove it now,

23:29.830 --> 23:31.760
Big Brother will truly be injured.

23:53.550 --> 23:56.110
Tang Rou, friends like these

23:56.590 --> 23:57.680
are best avoided.

23:58.480 --> 24:01.210
I'll take you home as soon as
I finish my business.

24:01.880 --> 24:02.440
Fang...

24:04.330 --> 24:05.790
Big Brother, are you okay?

24:06.320 --> 24:07.330
Seriously, still touching me?

24:07.330 --> 24:08.790
Sorry, I won't touch you again.

24:08.790 --> 24:10.310
Bear with it. It'll stop hurting soon.

24:10.310 --> 24:12.440
Don't worry. It's no big deal.

24:16.550 --> 24:17.920
This Jade Cicada

24:17.920 --> 24:20.580
can gather information
from the martial world.

24:20.830 --> 24:22.880
That does sound impressive.

24:26.200 --> 24:28.680
Mr. Feng, how did you come to know him?

24:29.440 --> 24:32.000
By chance, just like you and me.

24:32.350 --> 24:34.030
We were strangers just days ago,

24:34.030 --> 24:35.890
and now we're friends, aren't we?

24:38.750 --> 24:39.510
I see.

24:40.880 --> 24:43.590
Well, I have a problem now.

24:44.750 --> 24:45.720
My brother Yiren

24:45.720 --> 24:48.780
will soon become the young sect leader
of Huanhua Sect.

24:49.000 --> 24:49.530
Mr. Feng,

24:50.270 --> 24:53.160
how should I compete with him
for this position?

24:53.680 --> 24:55.680
You want to be the leader of Huanhua Sect?

24:55.680 --> 24:56.480
That's right.

24:58.160 --> 24:59.960
You're far behind your brother.

25:00.160 --> 25:02.160
However, there's a rule in Jinzhong

25:02.160 --> 25:03.350
that if a young hero

25:03.830 --> 25:06.240
can get a recommendation from
a renowned master in the martial world,

25:06.240 --> 25:08.170
they can challenge the successor.

25:14.680 --> 25:17.010
A renowned master in the martial world...

25:18.550 --> 25:19.240
Got it.

25:25.250 --> 25:28.030
[Omniscience Door]

25:41.270 --> 25:44.730
This is Tang Fang of the Tang Sect,
requesting to see Master Yu.

26:01.510 --> 26:03.720
I have something of your old friend.

26:04.110 --> 26:06.480
Please grant me a single word, Sir.

26:15.400 --> 26:17.750
Indeed, that's Master's style.

26:18.110 --> 26:20.040
Since you're a friend of Master's,

26:21.400 --> 26:22.400
go ahead and ask.

26:23.790 --> 26:26.310
Where exactly is the Voidheart Codex?

26:27.000 --> 26:29.160
In the Xiao Residence of Huanhua Sect.

26:31.310 --> 26:32.960
The Xiao Residence.

26:37.750 --> 26:39.030
So the rumors are true.

26:39.720 --> 26:43.000
Old Madam Wu is indeed hiding
in the Xiao Residence.

27:03.880 --> 27:05.590
Greetings, Old Madam Wu.

27:06.070 --> 27:07.470
Please, have a seat.

27:13.680 --> 27:17.400
Old Madam Wu, are you feeling better?

27:17.730 --> 27:21.990
[Old Madam Wu]

27:19.330 --> 27:22.660
I'm deeply grateful that you two

27:23.070 --> 27:24.880
have allowed me to take refuge here.

27:24.880 --> 27:28.310
Just some old ailments,
nothing worth mentioning.

27:29.640 --> 27:30.370
Old Madam Wu.

27:31.160 --> 27:34.160
I've received a secret letter
from General Wu Jie.

27:34.480 --> 27:35.280
In seven days,

27:35.440 --> 27:39.400
he'll send someone to Tongfu Inn
in Lingliang Town.

27:36.690 --> 27:37.800
[Zhang Linyi, Yin-Yang Divine Swordsman]

27:39.750 --> 27:40.590
At that time,

27:41.240 --> 27:42.400
my wife and I

27:43.000 --> 27:45.830
will secretly escort you to town

27:46.400 --> 27:47.800
to meet with the General.

27:49.030 --> 27:50.750
Thank you both for your trouble.

27:50.750 --> 27:52.310
Ever since Crazy Yan

27:52.400 --> 27:55.200
entrusted me with the Hero Command Token,

27:55.640 --> 27:59.480
the martial world has seen much bloodshed.

28:00.440 --> 28:03.880
Even with Mr. Zhang protecting me,

28:04.070 --> 28:05.730
I've faced danger many times.

28:06.270 --> 28:08.470
Thanks to your Xiao family's chivalry,

28:08.510 --> 28:10.510
letting me hide in the Huanhua Sect.

28:11.070 --> 28:15.350
Otherwise, I'm afraid the Hero's Token
would have fallen into the wrong hands.

28:15.350 --> 28:17.790
Old Madam Wu,
please don't say such things.

28:18.000 --> 28:18.830
This is simply

28:18.830 --> 28:21.110
our duty as martial artists.

28:21.830 --> 28:23.830
Secrets cannot be kept
in the martial world.

28:23.830 --> 28:26.270
I'm not sure whether
me hiding in the Xiao family

28:26.270 --> 28:29.510
can be kept secret
for the remaining seven days.

28:30.160 --> 28:34.110
Old Madam Wu, let the martial world
handle its own troubles.

28:35.030 --> 28:36.550
You needn't worry.

28:36.960 --> 28:37.960
We'll take care of

28:39.240 --> 28:40.400
everything.

28:43.160 --> 28:45.160
[Huanhua Sect]

28:45.270 --> 28:46.270
I grounded you,

28:46.720 --> 28:48.580
yet you went out causing trouble.

28:49.510 --> 28:50.840
Seems I was too lenient.

28:51.400 --> 28:54.160
You're forcing me to punish you
with our family law,

28:54.160 --> 28:54.820
aren't you?

28:54.880 --> 28:56.720
Come on, bend over!

28:56.720 --> 28:57.480
Father.

28:57.790 --> 29:00.070
I-I didn't go out
to cause trouble this time.

29:00.070 --> 29:02.200
I had important business to deal with.

29:02.200 --> 29:02.880
You?

29:03.240 --> 29:04.700
What important business?

29:06.480 --> 29:07.810
Being a hero, of course.

29:08.440 --> 29:09.830
You? Being a hero?

29:10.720 --> 29:11.830
Making up stories, huh?

29:11.830 --> 29:13.440
What a nice story!
Keep making things up, huh?

29:13.440 --> 29:14.680
Father, seriously, please don't hit me!

29:14.680 --> 29:16.160
Look, good deeds are usually done
anonymously,

29:16.160 --> 29:17.440
and those who seek recognition
rarely do good, right?

29:17.440 --> 29:20.270
Really? You've really made something
of yourself, haven't you?

29:20.270 --> 29:21.960
Fine. I'll grant your wish.

29:21.960 --> 29:22.420
Father!

29:23.410 --> 29:25.300
Stop hitting him!

29:25.480 --> 29:27.510
Stop hitting him!

29:28.030 --> 29:29.880
That's enough! What are you doing?

29:29.880 --> 29:31.400
What am I doing? I'm disciplining him.

29:31.400 --> 29:34.060
He just got back
and you're already hitting him.

29:35.400 --> 29:37.720
Your sister gathered some rehmannia
from the back mountain.

29:37.720 --> 29:39.000
I've already told the kitchen staff

29:39.000 --> 29:40.110
to make some chicken soup

29:40.110 --> 29:41.350
for your friends.

29:43.750 --> 29:45.070
Why are you still standing there?

29:45.070 --> 29:46.330
Go help in the kitchen.

29:46.400 --> 29:47.070
Come on.

29:47.640 --> 29:48.640
Where is he going?

29:49.440 --> 29:50.700
I'm disciplining him.

29:51.550 --> 29:53.790
You keep spoiling him like this,

29:53.880 --> 29:55.830
making him more and more reckless!

29:55.830 --> 29:58.200
You don't understand the situation at all.

29:58.200 --> 30:00.200
Qiushui really wasn't messing around
this time.

30:00.200 --> 30:01.840
I've already asked Yuhan and the others.

30:01.840 --> 30:03.830
They did go to watch dragon boat races
in Zihui.

30:03.830 --> 30:04.750
But think about it.

30:04.750 --> 30:05.590
Honoring Qu Yuan
on the Dragon Boat Festival

30:05.590 --> 30:07.270
is just a folk custom.

30:07.400 --> 30:09.240
Don't you remember
that you'd go every year

30:09.240 --> 30:10.750
when you were young?

30:10.750 --> 30:12.680
One year, you even fell into the river,

30:12.680 --> 30:14.000
and I was the one who pulled you out.

30:14.000 --> 30:16.440
Don't bring up me falling into the river
when I was young.

30:16.440 --> 30:18.240
Every time you mention this,
it's about me falling into the river.

30:18.240 --> 30:19.400
Do I have any dignity left?

30:19.400 --> 30:20.400
Well, did you fall into the river or not?

30:20.400 --> 30:21.030
Do you know that

30:21.030 --> 30:22.510
he even lost his sword?

30:22.680 --> 30:24.400
A swordsman who lost his sword.

30:24.400 --> 30:25.400
What kind of image is that?

30:25.400 --> 30:27.000
How can I not discipline him?

30:28.920 --> 30:29.350
I...

30:30.350 --> 30:31.880
Who allowed you to stand up?

30:32.590 --> 30:34.240
-Kneel!
-I told him to stand up.

30:34.240 --> 30:35.240
You... Kneel!

30:35.640 --> 30:36.570
Get out of my way.

30:36.640 --> 30:37.040
You...

30:37.400 --> 30:38.110
Hit me instead!

30:38.110 --> 30:39.770
How could you let him stand up?

30:40.240 --> 30:41.000
-Move.
-Then hit me instead.

30:41.000 --> 30:41.930
Get out of my way!

30:42.160 --> 30:42.640
Kneel!

30:43.030 --> 30:44.000
Hit me instead!

30:44.760 --> 30:45.420
Hey, you...

30:48.310 --> 30:48.920
Mother.

30:49.900 --> 30:51.500
Don't think I wouldn't dare!

30:52.400 --> 30:53.110
Mr. Xiao.

30:57.680 --> 30:59.810
Sorry we didn't welcome you properly.

31:02.030 --> 31:03.720
The vigor with which you lecture your son,

31:03.720 --> 31:06.320
it's been ages
since we've seen such a display.

31:06.550 --> 31:08.680
Youthful impulsiveness
isn't a major fault.

31:08.680 --> 31:09.880
Greetings, Mr. Xiao.

31:10.000 --> 31:11.060
Alright, Mr. Xiao.

31:11.310 --> 31:13.160
Let's go have some drinks.

31:13.680 --> 31:15.280
That's what really matters.

31:15.920 --> 31:17.200
Senior, please calm down.

31:17.200 --> 31:18.920
The ceremony to appoint
the young sect leader of Huanhua Sect

31:18.920 --> 31:19.920
Is ready outside.

31:21.030 --> 31:23.090
We have many things to attend to soon.

31:23.960 --> 31:25.480
Qiushui, come on.

31:25.880 --> 31:27.790
Come thank all your uncles.

31:28.110 --> 31:29.480
We'll leave then.

31:34.000 --> 31:36.330
What are you standing there for? Let's go.

31:36.880 --> 31:39.680
Mother, I want to be
the young sect leader.

31:44.260 --> 31:46.310
[Zhu Xiawu, Iron-Clad Constable,
Liushan Sect]

31:46.940 --> 31:48.010
[Kang Jiesheng, son of Kang Chuyu]
[Kang Chuyu, Sun-Gazing Divine Swordsman]

31:48.440 --> 31:50.790
Qiushui, what are you talking about?

31:55.000 --> 31:56.790
You want to compete with your brother?

31:56.790 --> 31:58.590
Don't be ridiculous. Leave now.

31:59.880 --> 32:00.480
Qiushui.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.640
Did you hear me?

32:03.160 --> 32:04.820
You're making me angry again.

32:10.510 --> 32:14.770
I, Xiao Qiushui, wish to compete for
the position of Huanhua's young leader.

32:14.920 --> 32:17.270
It so happens that
you're all here, uncles.

32:17.270 --> 32:19.000
Could you please recommend me?

32:26.510 --> 32:27.310
Qiushui.

32:29.510 --> 32:30.960
I'm not joking.

32:31.400 --> 32:34.550
I sincerely ask you seniors
to give me a chance.

32:38.350 --> 32:40.550
You're indeed full of vigor, young man.

32:40.590 --> 32:41.590
But do you know

32:41.880 --> 32:43.880
the position of young sect leader
has long been decided?

32:43.880 --> 32:44.960
Actually, I think

32:45.240 --> 32:48.170
we can take our time
to consider this matter further.

32:48.400 --> 32:49.640
Qiushui, my wise nephew,

32:49.640 --> 32:51.070
there's no need for haste.

32:51.070 --> 32:52.960
No, Uncle.

32:53.510 --> 32:54.640
I really can't wait.

32:55.160 --> 32:56.240
Dear uncles,

32:56.550 --> 32:58.720
if only one of you would recommend me

32:59.000 --> 33:00.400
and give me a letter of recommendation.

33:00.400 --> 33:01.720
Please consider me.

33:02.680 --> 33:04.140
Give me a chance, will you?

33:04.310 --> 33:06.590
Qiushui, it's not that we're unwilling,

33:07.200 --> 33:10.270
but Yiren truly deserves the position.

33:10.880 --> 33:13.920
In five years, I believe
you'll be ready to challenge.

33:14.510 --> 33:15.270
Five years?

33:17.720 --> 33:18.850
You must be kidding.

33:19.920 --> 33:22.510
Qiushui, stop messing around.

33:23.550 --> 33:24.380
Leave now.

33:24.590 --> 33:26.480
We still have important matters
to discuss.

33:26.480 --> 33:28.920
Reflect on the mistakes you made today.

33:28.920 --> 33:29.790
-Let's go, Qiushui.
-Father.

33:29.790 --> 33:30.590
-Qiushui.
-Leave now!

33:30.590 --> 33:31.310
-Let's go.
-Mother.

33:31.310 --> 33:32.310
Come on, get up.

33:34.310 --> 33:35.030
Let's go.

33:35.030 --> 33:36.110
We're leaving.

33:36.590 --> 33:37.790
We'll talk about it later.

33:37.790 --> 33:38.440
Uncle.

33:38.440 --> 33:39.160
Let's go.

33:41.110 --> 33:44.400
My unruly son has made a fool of himself.

33:44.790 --> 33:46.240
Please, sit down.

33:46.240 --> 33:47.790
Come on, please.

33:47.790 --> 33:48.550
Please.

33:51.160 --> 33:51.960
What's wrong?

33:52.120 --> 33:53.580
Is your shoulder injured?

33:53.680 --> 33:55.160
Mother, I'm fine.

33:55.680 --> 33:56.440
Let me see.

33:56.440 --> 33:58.400
Mother, it's really nothing.

34:02.400 --> 34:06.920
Mother, I won't make you angry anymore.

34:07.400 --> 34:09.800
I won't get into fights recklessly either.

34:11.150 --> 34:13.480
Do you think I'm angry because you fought?

34:14.150 --> 34:16.070
I'm angry because you were being reckless.

34:16.070 --> 34:18.760
In the martial world, fighting is common.

34:18.920 --> 34:21.250
But being reckless can cost you your life.

34:23.230 --> 34:24.230
I want my son

34:24.440 --> 34:26.440
to learn to say it hurts when he's injured

34:26.440 --> 34:28.190
and learn to run when he can't win.

34:28.190 --> 34:30.120
Don't try to be a hero, understand?

34:32.070 --> 34:33.199
I'll remember that.

34:33.550 --> 34:34.440
Don't worry.

34:34.960 --> 34:37.489
I'm quick when it comes to
running for my life.

34:40.000 --> 34:41.150
But I never thought

34:41.440 --> 34:43.630
our Qiushui would have such ideas.

34:44.400 --> 34:46.150
Although it's quite unrealistic,

34:46.150 --> 34:47.840
I really like it.

34:49.760 --> 34:50.760
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

34:50.760 --> 34:51.760
I forgot.

34:51.880 --> 34:52.610
Are you okay?

34:52.670 --> 34:53.360
I'm okay.

34:54.360 --> 34:56.960
You must be hungry.
I'll make you some noodles.

34:57.280 --> 34:57.960
Wait here.

35:08.000 --> 35:08.670
Mother.

35:09.590 --> 35:12.320
I will definitely change
our Xiao family's fate.

35:24.320 --> 35:25.630
When you were sick as a child,

35:25.630 --> 35:26.960
you loved this the most.

35:27.110 --> 35:27.760
Eat up.

35:37.480 --> 35:38.330
Mingming.

35:38.550 --> 35:39.110
Here.

35:39.870 --> 35:41.130
The noodles are ready.

36:18.760 --> 36:19.560
What's wrong?

36:27.760 --> 36:29.360
What's the matter, Qiushui?

36:30.000 --> 36:31.730
Are my noodles that delicious?

36:38.880 --> 36:41.740
It's just I haven't tasted this flavor
for too long.

36:42.760 --> 36:43.710
Silly boy.

36:44.190 --> 36:46.520
Didn't I make this for you
just last month?

36:46.840 --> 36:47.880
If you like it,

36:47.920 --> 36:48.510
I'll make it

36:48.510 --> 36:49.630
for you every day.

36:51.320 --> 36:52.380
Thank you, Mother.

36:57.710 --> 36:59.320
I've already instructed the kitchen staff.

36:59.320 --> 37:01.190
Tonight, let's treat your friends

37:01.190 --> 37:02.120
to a grand feast.

37:04.710 --> 37:05.670
Alright.

37:06.510 --> 37:08.590
You aim to be the young sect leader.

37:08.710 --> 37:09.570
Come on, eat up.

37:11.320 --> 37:11.880
I will.

37:25.230 --> 37:27.090
This is indeed the Marching Pill.

37:30.400 --> 37:32.200
After taking the Marching Pill,

37:32.590 --> 37:36.440
one feels no hunger or thirst,
but becomes violent and frenzied.

37:36.880 --> 37:38.140
More than a decade ago,

37:38.670 --> 37:41.110
Baicao Valley created this pill.

37:41.840 --> 37:43.710
They attempted to give it to
the Northern Wastelanders

37:43.710 --> 37:45.170
to bring calamity to Daxi.

37:45.360 --> 37:47.880
We righteous sects joined forces

37:48.320 --> 37:49.320
to eliminate them

37:49.920 --> 37:51.840
and destroyed all Marching Pills.

37:51.840 --> 37:54.710
I never expected that
after all these years,

37:55.440 --> 37:57.640
someone would create this thing again.

37:58.230 --> 38:00.280
It must be the remnants of Baicao Valley.

38:00.280 --> 38:02.800
If the Northern Wasteland obtains
this evil thing again,

38:02.800 --> 38:04.860
it will surely cause turmoil in Daxi.

38:06.190 --> 38:06.920
I think

38:07.670 --> 38:09.190
we should send some people

38:09.360 --> 38:11.020
to investigate in Guangling.

38:11.190 --> 38:14.320
I recall the Xiao family
has another residence in Guangling.

38:14.320 --> 38:16.650
Please make plans immediately, Mr. Xiao.

38:18.670 --> 38:20.730
I'll have things arranged tomorrow.

38:21.190 --> 38:22.440
Big Brother, you've lost weight recently.

38:22.440 --> 38:23.110
Aunt, please eat more.

38:23.110 --> 38:24.190
Do you know how long I've been waiting?

38:24.190 --> 38:25.800
-Finally, this day has come.
-Here.

38:25.800 --> 38:26.360
Thank you.

38:26.360 --> 38:27.440
Then eat more.

38:27.760 --> 38:28.560
You know what?

38:28.760 --> 38:30.320
Especially this
sweet bamboo shoots with pork.

38:30.320 --> 38:31.320
It's my favorite.

38:32.230 --> 38:34.030
I think you're wrong about that.

38:34.070 --> 38:35.270
Every dish Aunt makes

38:35.440 --> 38:37.110
is something I've been longing for.

38:37.110 --> 38:39.110
You're always such a sweet-talker.

38:39.960 --> 38:40.590
Eat more.

38:40.920 --> 38:42.110
Our Qiushui

38:42.150 --> 38:43.800
was raised strictly by his father.

38:43.800 --> 38:44.590
I was worried

38:44.760 --> 38:46.760
that he'd become timid and fearful.

38:46.840 --> 38:48.960
Thankfully, he has good friends like you,

38:48.960 --> 38:50.760
running wild together with him.

38:51.150 --> 38:52.760
Here, I'd like to toast to you all.

38:52.760 --> 38:54.190
-Cheers, Aunt.
-Cheers, Aunt.

38:54.190 --> 38:56.710
Is "running wild" a compliment
or criticism?

38:56.710 --> 38:58.030
That's just how our family talks.

38:58.030 --> 38:58.960
Come on, cheers.

38:59.110 --> 39:00.440
-Cheers.
-Let's get hammered today.

39:00.440 --> 39:02.100
Youth is meant for being wild.

39:11.840 --> 39:12.480
Thanks.

39:13.880 --> 39:15.410
Come on, Aunt, try some too.

39:15.630 --> 39:16.630
I'll help myself.

39:18.710 --> 39:20.070
Feng Lang, Mr. Feng.

39:20.920 --> 39:22.590
I just heard from Iron-Clad Constable

39:22.590 --> 39:24.920
that you've been a great help
to him this time.

39:24.920 --> 39:25.830
Meeting you today,

39:25.830 --> 39:27.590
you're truly
a fine and accomplished gentleman.

39:27.590 --> 39:29.390
Come on, let me toast you as well.

39:29.480 --> 39:30.940
Mrs. Xiao, you flatter me.

39:35.920 --> 39:38.720
Rain Sword, your lightness skill
is exceptional.

39:38.740 --> 39:41.690
You raced against a fine horse
for a day and night without losing.

39:41.690 --> 39:43.150
That's how you became famous.

39:43.150 --> 39:44.550
Mrs. Xiao, you're mistaken.

39:44.550 --> 39:45.710
Jiangnan is rich in waters.

39:45.710 --> 39:48.040
The thing I raced against
was a small boat.

39:54.230 --> 39:54.800
Qiushui.

39:54.910 --> 39:55.920
Look at me.

39:56.070 --> 39:58.330
I'm getting old and my memory is failing.

39:59.070 --> 40:01.670
So, Mr. Feng, what poison
were you struck with?

40:05.920 --> 40:07.920
Mother, it was the Noxious Beetles.

40:09.590 --> 40:11.590
The Noxious Beetles are truly rare.

40:11.590 --> 40:12.190
I wonder

40:12.360 --> 40:13.190
why the Power Gang

40:13.190 --> 40:15.590
would poison you like this, Mr. Feng?

40:16.480 --> 40:18.150
I told Xiao about this before.

40:19.360 --> 40:21.220
I saw something I shouldn't have.

40:29.190 --> 40:32.520
Have you heard about the massacre
at Changle Escort Agency?

40:38.570 --> 40:41.960
It happened a few days ago.
Everyone in Jinzhong is talking about it.

40:41.960 --> 40:44.020
I was there on the day of the massacre.

40:44.480 --> 40:47.190
I was planning to hire
Changle Escort Agency for a job.

40:47.190 --> 40:50.230
But unexpectedly, I ran into Power Gang
committing the crime.

40:50.230 --> 40:51.800
Although I managed to escape,

40:51.800 --> 40:53.000
I was still poisoned.

40:54.070 --> 40:57.530
I heard Liu Suifeng from the Power Gang
was also there that day.

40:57.590 --> 40:59.920
To survive an encounter with that villain

41:00.070 --> 41:01.800
is truly remarkable, Mr. Feng.

41:08.800 --> 41:09.400
Feng Lang.

41:10.230 --> 41:12.840
What were you hiring
the Changle Escort Agency to transport?

41:12.840 --> 41:16.440
The letter my master asked me to deliver
to Iron-Clad Constable.

41:18.320 --> 41:19.780
I did escape by sheer luck,

41:20.550 --> 41:21.630
but I think I heard

41:22.190 --> 41:23.710
that the Power Gang's massacre

41:23.710 --> 41:25.440
was to find someone important.

41:26.110 --> 41:27.240
I wonder if any of you

41:27.590 --> 41:29.450
have heard any rumors on the road.

41:31.630 --> 41:33.280
I haven't heard anything about that.

41:33.280 --> 41:34.920
The Changle Escort Agency is in Jinzhong.

41:34.920 --> 41:37.650
Could that important person also
be in Jinzhong?

41:38.000 --> 41:41.000
Aunt, your Huanhua Sect
has extensive connections in Jinzhong.

41:41.000 --> 41:41.840
Have you heard of

41:41.840 --> 41:43.570
any important figures coming?

41:46.840 --> 41:47.840
I haven't.

41:54.360 --> 41:57.190
These trivial matters of the martial world
are such a mood killer.

41:57.190 --> 41:58.670
Let's not talk about it today.

41:58.670 --> 42:01.150
Today, let's just drink to
our heart's content!

42:01.150 --> 42:02.230
Right, drink to our heart's content.

42:02.230 --> 42:02.920
Drink to our heart's content.

42:02.920 --> 42:03.960
Come on, let's drink to
our heart's content.

42:03.960 --> 42:04.480
Cheers!

42:05.280 --> 42:06.940
Come, let's drink up. Cheers!

42:07.030 --> 42:09.030
-Bottoms up.
-Cheers, Big Brother.

42:09.960 --> 42:10.920
Thank you for your hospitality, Aunt!

42:10.920 --> 42:11.840
Thanks for having us.
